1
00:00:12,672 --> 00:00:19,072
The penguin is my favourite animal. What’s your favourite animal, Fu Xing?

2
00:00:19,296 --> 00:00:22,960
I like penguins too. Why do you like them so much?

3
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,744
Because they’re very cute 

4
00:00:26,112 --> 00:00:29,376
Yes, they look lovely. Let’s go and see them.

5
00:00:29,776 --> 00:00:36,416
Oh, there they are! They can’t fly like other birds, but they can swim fast. 

6
00:00:36,944 --> 00:00:40,592
I like how they walk. It’s funny

7
00:00:40,816 --> 00:00:43,808
Yes, it is! Where are they from?

8
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:49,872
Look here! It says they’re from Antarctica. It’s very cold there

9
00:00:50,064 --> 00:00:54,576
so they often stand close together. It helps them keep warm.

10
00:00:54,928 --> 00:00:58,288
They’re so smart. What do they eat?

11
00:00:58,672 --> 00:01:03,968
Fish and small sea animals,I think. I have a fish sandwich ...

12
00:01:04,192 --> 00:01:07,904
Don’t give them your sandwich! It’s not good for them.

